<title>HONG KONG: Rabobank Hong Kong branch sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Rabobank Hong Kong branch sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger and bookrunner HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER  RABOBANK, HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$400 MLN IN TWO TRANCHES.</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE (A):  HK$300 MLN</p>
<p>	     TRANCHE (B):  HK$100 MLN</p>
<p> COUPON    (A)  6.5 PCT, (B)  7.0 PCT</p>
<p>MATURITY  (A)  3 YRS (DUE 03.DEC.99), (B) 5 YRS (DUE 03.DEC.01)</p>
<p>TYPE  FIXED RATE CD  ISS PRICE  UNDISCLOSED LAUNCHED 18.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	 CALLS	NONE	  REPLIES   CLOSED</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	 REPAYMENT  BULLET	DENOMS    HK$500K</p>
<p> RATING    **	   SALE LMTS  CUSTOMARY   TAX PROV  ***</p>
<p> NEG PLG   NO	   CRS DEF    NO	    FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY NEDERLANDS GOV LAW    HONG KONG   PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>PAY DATE  (A) &amp; (B)  03.DEC.96</p>
<p> ARRANGER    HSBC MARKETS (BOOKS)</p>
<p> CO-LEAD MANAGER   JARDINE FLEMING</p>
<p> PAY AGENT   HONGKONG BANK</p>
<p> NOTES    SENIOR, UNSUBORDINATED DEBT, PARI PASSU.</p>
<p>	    CLEARING THROUGH HK CMU.</p>
<p>	    REDEMPTION PRICE AT 100 PCT.</p>
<p>	    ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S HK$1.5 BLN CD PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>	    SIGNING IS TENTATIVELY SET FOR NOVEMBER 28.</p>
<p>	  **PARENT RATINGS Aaa/AAA.</p>
<p>	 ***WITHHOLDING TAX GROSS UP</p>
<p>	****YIELD UNDISCLOSED</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
